{
  "_comment_headers": [
    "Added 2026-09-06. There was no headers block at all, so every static",
    "asset served with Vercel's default max-age=0, must-revalidate — meaning",
    "every navigation between tools re-validated 8 stylesheets, core.js and a",
    "165KB font: 10+ conditional round-trips per page load, forever. This is",
    "by far the largest real performance item in the suite; the CSS cleanup",
    "beside it is worth ~0.5KB gzipped and was done for correctness, not speed.",
    "shared/vendor/* is immutable — vendored libraries and the font never",
    "change in place, they are replaced by a differently-named file.",
    "shared/*.css|js gets 5 minutes of freshness plus a day of",
    "stale-while-revalidate: navigation is instant, and a deploy is picked up",
    "within 5 minutes (immediately on a hard reload)."
  ],
  "_comment_order": [
    "Order matters: Vercel applies EVERY matching rule and the last one to set",
    "a given header wins. shared/vendor/ also holds .js, so it would match the",
    "first rule too — it is listed second so immutable wins there."
  ],
  "headers": [
    {
      "source": "/shared/(.*).(css|js)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=300, stale-while-revalidate=86400" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/shared/vendor/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rewrites": [
    {
      "source": "/genesis/(.*)",
      "destination": "/genesis/$1"
    },
    {
      "source": "/spore/(.*)",
      "destination": "/spore/$1"
    },
    {
      "source": "/pollen/(.*)",
      "destination": "/pollen/$1"
    },
    {
      "source": "/livingpath/(.*)",
      "destination": "/livingpath/$1"
    },
    {
      "source": "/sinew/(.*)",
      "destination": "/sinew/$1"
    },
    {
      "source": "/halide/(.*)",
      "destination": "/halide/$1"
    },
    {
      "source": "/komorebi/(.*)",
      "destination": "/komorebi/$1"
    },
    {
      "source": "/camo-turing/(.*)",
      "destination": "/camo-turing/$1"
    },
    {
      "source": "/warping/(.*)",
      "destination": "/warping/$1"
    },
    {
      "source": "/loom/(.*)",
      "destination": "/loom/$1"
    },
    {
      "source": "/membrane/(.*)",
      "destination": "/membrane/$1"
    },
    {
      "source": "/vortex/(.*)",
      "destination": "/vortex/$1"
    },
    {
